space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">c.</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Awards of time-vested restricted stock were granted to Mr. Loyd in connection with his compensation as a board member during the fiscal year 2022. These awards vested in full on December 8, 2022, the date of the prior year&#8217;s annual meeting of stockholders of the Company.</span></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:12pt;"></div></ix:continuation><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:12pt;line-height:1.43;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(3)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><ix:continuation id="Group_6jzedhihoE2F215xaNx_7Q_2"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">For all fiscal years presented, our non-PEO NEOs include Mr. Bunch and Mr. Stash. Mr. Bunch was appointed Chief Operating Officer on February 21, 2023. Averages for all fiscal years presented were calculated using a straight average of amounts earned, if any, for each category by Mr. Bunch and Mr. Stash during the years.</span></ix:continuation><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;white-space:pre-wrap;">  </span></td></tr></table><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_6_30_2025_vnuaQFwTAkqow0GIx33Xdg" name="ecd:AdjToNonPeoNeoCompFnTextBlock" id="Tb_MyKQT2UkokGRW0AdwNncMg" escape="true"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:12pt;line-height:1.43;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><t